		"description": "<p>You shoot a skewering tendril of condensed, flailing darkness at a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d8 necrotic damage; if the target is Large-sized or smaller, you can also force the creature to move 5 feet in a direction you choose.</p><p>This spell&rsquo;s damage increases by 1d8 when you reach 5th level (2d8), 11th level (3d8), and 17th level (4d8)</p>",
